---
/** Original unbranded illustration of an architectural-film corner, not a product specification. */
---
<figure class="film-wrap-diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 560 350" role="img" aria-label="Schematic architectural film fitted to a prepared panel face and returned around an edge. The actual edge detail follows the film maker's instructions." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path class="panel" d="m85 72 246-30 113 69v183l-246 30-113-69Z" />
    <path class="face" d="m85 72 246-30v183L85 255Z" />
    <path class="film" d="m90 76 235-29v172L90 249Z" />
    <path class="edge" d="m325 47 25 15v172l-25-15Z" />
    <path d="M331 42v183l113 69M85 255l113 69v-183L85 72M198 141l246-30" />
    <path class="leader" d="m190 155-66-107H30m307 108 80-108h115" />
    <text x="28" y="30">Prepared face</text><text x="388" y="30">Edge return</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption><span>Schematic · not to scale</span>Plan the face, edge returns and junctions before applying the film. Preparation and corner details follow the maker’s instructions.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure { margin:0; padding:1rem; background:var(--color-paper); border:1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius:var(--radius-control); }
  svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; fill:none; stroke:var(--color-stone); stroke-width:1.5; stroke-linejoin:round; }
  .panel { fill:var(--color-ivory-deep); } .face { fill:var(--color-panel); } .film { fill:var(--color-ivory); } .edge { fill:var(--color-gold); }
  .leader { stroke:var(--color-brass); } text { font:26px 'Outfit',sans-serif; fill:var(--color-ink); stroke:none; }
  figcaption { display:grid; gap:.4rem; margin-top:.8rem; color:var(--color-stone); font-size:var(--text-meta); line-height:1.55; }
  figcaption span { color:var(--color-brass); font-size:var(--text-label); letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
</style>
